WEBVTT

00:07.241 --> 00:08.517
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.586 --> 00:10.206
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.275 --> 00:11.689
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:11.758 --> 00:13.620
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:13.689 --> 00:16.689
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:16.758 --> 00:18.793
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:18.862 --> 00:20.793
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:20.862 --> 00:22.689
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:22.758 --> 00:24.344
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.413 --> 00:26.827
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:26.896 --> 00:28.793
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:28.862 --> 00:30.758
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:30.827 --> 00:32.793
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:32.862 --> 00:34.655
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:34.724 --> 00:36.758
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:36.827 --> 00:38.896
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.965 --> 00:40.241
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.310 --> 00:42.103
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.172 --> 00:44.827
[laughing]
[笑]

00:44.896 --> 00:47.137
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.206 --> 00:48.655
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.241 --> 01:01.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.344 --> 01:04.068
- [imitates engine revving]
- [模仿发动机转速]

01:04.137 --> 01:06.620
I'm a stunt driver,
and I'm making donuts!
我是一名特技车手
我正在做甜甜圈！

01:06.689 --> 01:08.758
[screeches]
Out of the way!
[尖叫声]
让开！

01:08.827 --> 01:10.724
[screeches]
Look out!
[尖叫声]
当心！

01:10.793 --> 01:12.655
Where'd you learn
to drive, buddy?
你在哪里学的
开车吗，伙计？

01:12.724 --> 01:14.758
Oh, Mrs. Puff's
Boating School?
哦，泡芙夫人的
划船学校？

01:14.827 --> 01:17.275
Me too!
[laughs]
我也是！
[笑]

01:17.344 --> 01:19.000
Ahh, the bridge is out!
啊啊，桥出来了！

01:19.068 --> 01:20.827
Ahhh!
啊啊！

01:20.896 --> 01:22.724
- That's a sweet little boat.
- 那是一艘可爱的小船。

01:22.793 --> 01:24.482
You're a smart shopper.
您是一位聪明的购物者。

01:24.551 --> 01:26.655
- Oh, I'm not shopping.
I'm playing.
- 哦，我不购物。
我正在玩。

01:26.724 --> 01:28.310
- Playing, huh?
- 玩，嗯？

01:28.379 --> 01:32.241
Well, we have some very
playful items here for a--a...
嗯，我们有一些非常
这里有一些有趣的物品，适合...

01:32.310 --> 01:33.724
- Ehh-ehh.
- 呃呃。

01:33.793 --> 01:36.482
- ...sophisticated motorist
like yourself.
- ...老练的驾驶者
就像你自己一样。

01:36.551 --> 01:37.517
- Whoa!
- 哇！

01:37.586 --> 01:39.275
- The Nerdmobile.
- 书呆子车。

01:39.344 --> 01:40.965
It comes with
pocket protectors,
它配备了
口袋保护器，

01:41.034 --> 01:44.275
corrective lens windshield
and seat wedgies.
矫正镜片挡风玻璃
和座椅楔子。

01:44.344 --> 01:47.379
- Ah-ow! Wow.
- No, this isn't right.
- 啊-哦！哇。
- 不，这是不对的。

01:47.448 --> 01:49.206
I got something
more your style.
我得到了一些东西
更符合你的风格。

01:49.275 --> 01:51.344
- Whee!
- 呼！

01:51.413 --> 01:52.689
- The Wimp Wagon.
- 懦夫马车。

01:52.758 --> 01:55.551
It includes unlimited tissues
for crying,
它包括无限的组织
因为哭泣，

01:55.620 --> 01:59.103
a security blanket,
安全毯，

01:59.172 --> 02:03.689
and a bumper bonnet for your
delicate fontanel.
以及为您准备的保险杠引擎盖
娇嫩的囟门。

02:03.758 --> 02:05.620
- Oh, these are very nice,
- 哦，这些非常好，

02:05.689 --> 02:07.275
but I don't have
a driver's license.
但我没有
驾驶执照。

02:07.344 --> 02:08.551
- No license, huh?
- 没有执照，是吧？

02:08.620 --> 02:09.827
Well, you don't need a license
嗯，你不需要许可证

02:09.896 --> 02:12.275
to drive a self-driving boat.
驾驶自动驾驶船。

02:12.344 --> 02:14.827
- Self-driving?
[whimpers]
- 自驾？
[呜咽]

02:14.896 --> 02:18.034
- Meet Coupe.
It's very classy.
- 认识一下轿跑车。
这是非常优雅的。

02:18.103 --> 02:21.275
Chrome-plated exterior,
titanium hubcaps,
外部镀铬，
钛合金轮毂盖，

02:21.344 --> 02:22.689
turbine engine,
涡轮发动机,

02:22.758 --> 02:24.758
and personal driver narration.
以及个人司机解说。

02:24.827 --> 02:27.172
- Ooh.
Whaaa!
- 哦。
哇啊！

02:27.241 --> 02:28.275
Sold!
卖！

02:28.344 --> 02:30.586
- Oh, thanks.
[laughs]
-哦，谢谢。
[笑]

02:30.655 --> 02:33.344
- Ahhh!
My very own boat.
- 啊啊！
我自己的船。

02:33.413 --> 02:35.931
Ah!
啊!

02:36.000 --> 02:38.172
Huh?
But there's no key!
啊？
但没有钥匙！

02:38.241 --> 02:39.758
And no steering wheel!
而且没有方向盘！

02:39.827 --> 02:42.448
[stammering]
Where is that--I gotta--
[结巴]
那在哪里——我得——

02:42.517 --> 02:44.034
[cat meows]
[猫喵喵叫]

02:44.103 --> 02:45.931
How do you--
你怎么——

02:46.000 --> 02:48.689
- Settle down,
Mr. SquarePants.
- 安定下来，
方裤先生。

02:48.758 --> 02:52.344
- Wow, you talk.
How'd you know my name?
- 哇，你说话了。
你怎么知道我的名字？

02:52.413 --> 02:55.965
- I can feel your
square pants on my seat.
- 我能感觉到你的
方裤在我的座位上。

02:56.034 --> 02:57.896
Where to, Mr. SquarePants?
去哪儿，方裤先生？

02:57.965 --> 02:59.620
- Oh, why don't we just
go for a drive?
-哦，我们为什么不直接
开车去兜风吗？

02:59.689 --> 03:02.034
- You've got it.
- 你明白了。

03:02.103 --> 03:03.448
- Oh.
- 哦。

03:03.517 --> 03:05.000
Whoa, careful!
哇，小心点！

03:05.068 --> 03:07.827
And stay in your lane!
Stop sign! Stop sign!
并留在你的车道上！
停止标志！停止标志！

03:07.896 --> 03:09.586
Truck, truck, truck, truck.
Ahh!
卡车，卡车，卡车，卡车。
啊！

03:09.655 --> 03:11.620
- Relax, Mr. SquarePants.
- 放松点，方裤先生。

03:11.689 --> 03:13.655
I'm an expert driver.
我是一名专业司机。

03:13.724 --> 03:18.068
Make yourself at home
and leave everything to me.
让自己像在家一样
并把一切都交给我。

03:19.551 --> 03:22.068
- Hmm. Huh?
[horn honks]
- 唔。啊？
[喇叭鸣响]

03:22.137 --> 03:23.620
- Hi, Squidward.
- 嗨，章鱼哥。

03:23.689 --> 03:26.413
[instrument blares,
horn honks]
[乐器声，
喇叭鸣响]

03:26.482 --> 03:30.034
- Oh, I need to erase this
from my mind.
- 哦，我需要删除这个
从我的脑海中。

03:31.620 --> 03:34.965
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:35.034 --> 03:38.344
Duh!
What's a SpongeBob?
呃！
什么是海绵宝宝？

03:41.965 --> 03:43.896
- Oh, hi, Mrs. Puff.
- 哦，嗨，帕芙女士。

03:43.965 --> 03:45.896
What do you think
of my classy new boat?
你觉得怎么样
我的优雅新船？

03:45.965 --> 03:47.620
- Hello, SpongeBob.
- 你好，海绵宝宝。

03:47.689 --> 03:49.344
SpongeBob, ah!
海绵宝宝啊！

03:49.413 --> 03:51.103
You're not driving.
你没开车。

03:51.172 --> 03:52.827
- I know.
Isn't it great?
- 我知道。
不是很好吗？

03:52.896 --> 03:54.862
[horn blares]
- Ahhh!
[喇叭声]
- 啊啊！

04:00.172 --> 04:02.241
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:06.482 --> 04:09.793
- Oh, that was the best day
of non-driving ever.
- 哦，那是最好的一天
从未驾驶过。

04:09.862 --> 04:11.448
Coupe, is there anything
I can get you?
轿跑车，有什么吗
我可以得到你吗？

04:11.517 --> 04:14.000
Warm glass of oil?
Triple-foam conditioner?
温杯油吗？
三重泡沫护发素？

04:14.068 --> 04:17.344
- I'm fine.
Good night, Mr. SquarePants.
- 我很好。
晚安，方裤先生。

04:17.413 --> 04:19.413
- Good night, Coupe.
- 晚安，库珀。

04:22.793 --> 04:25.586
[thunder rumbles]
[雷声隆隆]

04:25.655 --> 04:27.896
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

04:29.931 --> 04:31.586
What's wrong, Coupe?
怎么了，库珀？

04:31.655 --> 04:34.172
- I'm getting wet.
- 我被淋湿了。

04:34.241 --> 04:35.724
- Whoa!
- 哇！

04:35.793 --> 04:39.448
Here, take this!
给，拿着这个！

04:39.517 --> 04:41.103
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

04:41.172 --> 04:43.620
What's up?
- I'm cold.
这是怎么回事？
- 我很冷。

04:43.689 --> 04:45.000
- Aww.
- 哇。

04:45.068 --> 04:47.413
There you go,
my widdle self-driver.
就这样吧，
我的自驾游。

04:47.482 --> 04:49.068
Nice and snuggy-wuggy.
漂亮又舒适。

04:49.137 --> 04:52.103
- I don't like it out here.
I want to be inside.
- 我不喜欢这里。
我想呆在里面。

04:52.172 --> 04:53.413
- Inside?
- 里面？

04:53.482 --> 04:55.275
[sawing]
[锯切]

04:55.344 --> 05:00.034
All right, Coupe.
Come on in.
好吧，库珀。
进来吧。

05:00.103 --> 05:03.000
[woman screaming on TV,
engine revving]
[女人在电视上尖叫，
发动机转速]

05:03.068 --> 05:04.758
[dinosaurs growling,
monster growling]
[恐龙咆哮，
怪物咆哮]

05:04.827 --> 05:06.689
- Hey, you know what'd be fun?
- 嘿，你知道什么有趣吗？

05:06.758 --> 05:08.551
If I sat in you
and we pretended
如果我坐在你身边
我们假装

05:08.620 --> 05:09.724
we were in a drive-in movie.
我们在看一场汽车电影院。

05:09.793 --> 05:12.586
- No, it wouldn't.
- 不，不会的。

05:12.655 --> 05:14.655
- Okay, so I guess you're
just gonna click through
- 好吧，所以我猜你是
只需点击即可

05:14.724 --> 05:17.482
the channels looking for a boat
commercial all night, huh?
寻找船只的海峡
通宵做广告吧？

05:17.551 --> 05:19.275
- Oh, I'm sorry.
- 哦，对不起。

05:19.344 --> 05:21.551
I thought I was a guest here.
我以为我是这里的客人。

05:21.620 --> 05:23.965
- Of course you are.
- 当然是。

05:24.034 --> 05:26.724
Well, I'm tired.
You can stay up.
好吧，我累了。
你可以熬夜。

05:26.793 --> 05:29.172
I'm going to bed.
我要去睡觉了。

05:29.241 --> 05:30.482
Oh, Coupe?
哦，轿跑车？

05:30.551 --> 05:33.965
Good-night.
I had a wonderful day.
晚安。
我度过了美好的一天。

05:34.034 --> 05:37.172
[sounds from
television continue]
[声音来自
电视继续]

05:37.241 --> 05:39.862
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

05:39.931 --> 05:41.413
Ohh!
- Ow.
哦！
- 噢。

05:41.482 --> 05:44.000
- Gary, what is what?
- 加里，什么是什么？

05:44.068 --> 05:45.448
[hyperventilating]
[换气过度]

05:45.517 --> 05:50.758
[horn blares]
[喇叭声]

05:50.827 --> 05:54.275
- Sorry, Mr. SquarePants,
I'm so...[yawns]
- 对不起，方裤先生，
我真是……[哈欠]

05:54.344 --> 05:55.310
- I know, Coupe.
- 我知道，库普。

05:55.379 --> 05:57.241
You're tired.
We're all tired.
你累了。
我们都累了。

05:57.310 --> 05:59.344
[horn blaring rhythmically]
[有节奏的喇叭声]

05:59.413 --> 06:01.448
[sighs]
[叹气]

06:01.517 --> 06:03.517
[horn continues blaring]
[喇叭继续鸣响]

06:08.000 --> 06:10.034
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

06:10.103 --> 06:12.310
[horn blares, both scream]
[喇叭声，两人尖叫]

06:13.896 --> 06:16.034
Ow.
噢。

06:20.896 --> 06:23.103
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:24.379 --> 06:27.655
- Mr. SquarePants,
I can drive you to work.
- 方裤先生，
我可以开车送你去上班。

06:27.724 --> 06:29.034
Why are you walking?
你为什么走路？

06:29.103 --> 06:31.758
- Oh, yeah, well,
I didn't want to wake you.
- 哦，是的，好吧，
我不想吵醒你。

06:31.827 --> 06:33.793
You were sleeping like a baby.
你睡得像个婴儿。

06:33.862 --> 06:37.931
Heh. Baby buggy!
[laughs] Baby buggy...
呵呵。婴儿车！
[笑] 婴儿车...

06:41.482 --> 06:45.344
- Hey SpongeBob,
how about a ride?
- 嘿海绵宝宝，
搭车怎么样？

06:45.413 --> 06:47.241
- Well, sure, Patrick.
Hop in.
- 嗯，当然，帕特里克。
跳进去。

06:47.310 --> 06:48.620
- Yay!
- 耶！

06:48.689 --> 06:51.862
[horn blares]
[喇叭声]

06:51.931 --> 06:54.275
Oh, oh boy!
噢，天哪！

06:54.344 --> 06:56.000
Buttons!
按钮！

06:56.068 --> 06:58.241
[laughing]
[笑]

06:58.310 --> 07:00.448
- Patrick, could you not--
- 帕特里克，你能不能——

07:00.517 --> 07:03.482
I don't think he--
Don't get your--
我不认为他——
别明白你的——

07:03.551 --> 07:05.034
- Butt on buttons!
- 按下按钮！

07:05.103 --> 07:06.896
- Uh, Patrick, I don't think
Coupe likes that.
- 呃，帕特里克，我不认为
轿跑车喜欢这样。

07:06.965 --> 07:10.517
- Passenger, settle down.
- 乘客，安定下来。

07:10.586 --> 07:12.655
- Hey, ice cream.
Where's the cone?
- 嘿，冰淇淋。
圆锥体在哪里？

07:12.724 --> 07:15.827
- Oh, don't worry.
It's down there somewhere.
- 哦，别担心。
它就在下面某个地方。

07:15.896 --> 07:18.551
Ahh.
啊。

07:18.620 --> 07:20.103
[excited grunting]
[兴奋的咕噜声]

07:20.172 --> 07:22.034
[Coupe groans, spits]
[轿跑车呻吟，吐口水]

07:22.103 --> 07:23.551
[excited grunting]
[兴奋的咕噜声]

07:23.620 --> 07:26.068
- Ugh, Eww.
All right, that's enough!
- 呃，呃。
好吧，够了！

07:26.137 --> 07:30.620
- Thanks for the ride!
- 感谢您的搭车！

07:30.689 --> 07:32.689
- Here we are.
- 我们到了。

07:32.758 --> 07:34.448
- Here we are, where?
- 我们在这里，在哪里？

07:34.517 --> 07:36.517
- Where I work,
the Krusty Krab.
- 我工作的地方，
蟹堡王。

07:36.586 --> 07:39.517
- What?
I can't be seen here.
- 什么？
我在这里看不见。

07:39.586 --> 07:41.448
I'm a classy car.
我是一辆高级车。

07:41.517 --> 07:44.413
This place is tacky.
[flatulence sound]
这个地方很俗气。
[胀气声]

07:44.482 --> 07:48.000
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

07:48.068 --> 07:50.758
Coupe, open the door!
I'll be late.
轿跑车，开门！
我会迟到的。

07:50.827 --> 07:54.310
Yow!
But I have to go to work!
哟！
但我还得去上班！

07:54.379 --> 07:56.241
Ah.
啊。

07:56.310 --> 07:58.241
- You obviously
have no taste,
- 显然你
没有品味，

07:58.310 --> 08:01.103
so today we're going to do
what I want to do.
所以今天我们要做
我想做的事。

08:01.172 --> 08:03.758
- But I have to go to work.
[groans]
- 但我必须去上班。
[呻吟]

08:04.758 --> 08:07.620
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:07.689 --> 08:09.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:09.517 --> 08:12.620
[gargling]
[漱口]

08:12.689 --> 08:14.275
[groaning]
[呻吟]

08:14.344 --> 08:16.206
I have to go to work.
我得去上班了。

08:16.275 --> 08:19.586
[tools whirring, clanging]
[工具发出呼呼声、叮当声]

08:19.655 --> 08:21.620
But I have to go to work!
但我还得去上班！

08:30.344 --> 08:32.586
Huh?
[cash register dings]
啊？
[收银机叮叮声]

08:32.655 --> 08:34.103
Ugh.
啊。

08:34.172 --> 08:36.827
I have to go--
- Go to work?
我得走了——
- 去上班吗？

08:36.896 --> 08:38.862
- No, go to the bathroom.
- 不，去趟洗手间。

08:38.931 --> 08:40.206
- You can hold it.
- 你可以握住它。

08:40.275 --> 08:42.275
- Or I could just go.
[fly unzips]
- 或者我可以走。
[飞拉开拉链]

08:42.344 --> 08:44.551
- Ugh. Make it snappy.
- 呃。让它变得活泼。

08:44.620 --> 08:46.655
- Ow!
[groans]
- 噢！
[呻吟]

08:48.275 --> 08:51.827
- Hmm?
Hmm.
- 唔？
唔。

08:51.896 --> 08:54.103
Hmm.
唔。

08:55.172 --> 08:56.172
Hmm.
唔。

08:56.241 --> 08:58.965
- Eh?
[whistles]
- 呃？
[口哨声]

08:59.034 --> 09:00.689
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

09:00.758 --> 09:03.724
Hmm.
[stammering]
唔。
[结巴]

09:05.448 --> 09:07.517
Very funny, Coupe.
Very funny.
非常有趣，库珀。
很搞笑。

09:07.586 --> 09:10.068
- What's in the bag?
- Oh, nothing.
- 包里有什么？
- 哦，没什么。

09:10.137 --> 09:11.896
Hey, wait!
嘿，等等！

09:11.965 --> 09:13.793
- What are you doing,
SquarePants?
- 你在做什么，
方裤？

09:13.862 --> 09:17.103
- I'm going to work.
- 我要去工作了。

09:17.172 --> 09:18.931
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:19.000 --> 09:22.137
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:22.206 --> 09:24.482
[tires screeching]
- Ooh.
[轮胎的尖叫声]
- 哦。

09:24.551 --> 09:26.586
- Did that hurt?
- Of course not.
- 疼吗？
- 当然不是。

09:26.655 --> 09:29.448
I'm a boat.
I don't feel physical pain.
我是一条船。
我感觉不到身体上的疼痛。

09:29.517 --> 09:33.241
- Good to know,
because I'm a stunt driver,
- 很高兴知道，
因为我是一名特技车手

09:33.310 --> 09:35.241
and I'm making donuts.
我正在做甜甜圈。

09:35.310 --> 09:37.517
[Coupe screaming]
[轿跑车尖叫]

09:38.758 --> 09:40.827
- Oh, no you don't.
- 哦，不，你不知道。

09:40.896 --> 09:43.103
Give me that!
给我那个！

09:45.172 --> 09:48.034
- Yahh!
- Ohh!
- 呀！
- 哦！

09:48.103 --> 09:49.068
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:49.137 --> 09:50.620
[Coupe laughs]
[轿跑车笑]

09:50.689 --> 09:54.517
Now this is where
I should be living.
现在这是哪里
我应该活着。

09:54.586 --> 09:57.206
Penthouse parking lot,
please.
顶层公寓停车场，
请。

09:57.275 --> 09:58.931
[ding]
Thank you.
[叮]
谢谢你。

09:59.000 --> 10:01.172
- Hi, how you doing today?
Good?
- 嗨，你今天过得怎么样？
好的？

10:01.241 --> 10:04.000
[whistles]
[口哨声]

10:04.068 --> 10:07.344
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

10:07.413 --> 10:10.482
Well played, Coupe.
- Indeed.
打得好，库珀。
- 的确。

10:10.551 --> 10:14.137
- And now we can get to
the Krusty Krab the fast way!
- 现在我们可以到达
蟹堡王的快捷方式！

10:14.206 --> 10:17.620
- What? No! No!
Noooo!
- 什么？不！不！
不！

10:17.689 --> 10:20.241
No, you don't.
- [straining]
不，你不知道。
- [紧张]

10:20.310 --> 10:24.482
- No, no, we're not going
into the tacky Krusty Krab.
- 不，不，我们不会去
进入俗气的蟹堡王。

10:24.551 --> 10:28.896
- You're right, we're going
through the drive-thru!
- 你说得对，我们要去
通过驾车穿过！

10:28.965 --> 10:31.931
Triple Krabby Patty with five
scoops of ice cream please.
三重蟹肉饼与五个
请给我几勺冰淇淋。

10:32.000 --> 10:34.275
[straining]
[紧张]

10:38.413 --> 10:41.000
Squidward, you see me
struggling with this boat,
章鱼哥，你看见我了
与这艘船苦苦挣扎，

10:41.068 --> 10:42.724
and you act like
you don't care.
你表现得像
你不在乎。

10:42.793 --> 10:44.827
- It's not an act.
- 这不是一种行为。

10:47.034 --> 10:48.413
- I hate do you this to you,
- 我讨厌这样对你，

10:48.482 --> 10:50.655
Triple Krabby Patty
with five scoops of ice cream,
三重蟹肉饼
配上五勺冰淇淋，

10:50.724 --> 10:52.344
but I have no choice.
但我别无选择。

10:52.413 --> 10:55.172
- Oh, no, stop!
I don't like that.
- 哦，不，停下来！
我不喜欢这样。

10:55.241 --> 10:58.206
[tires screech]
- Hey, SpongeBob!
[轮胎尖叫声]
- 嘿，海绵宝宝！

10:58.275 --> 11:00.551
- Oh, not this idiot again.
- 哦，别再是这个白痴了。

11:00.620 --> 11:02.758
- Ahhh!
- 啊啊！

11:02.827 --> 11:05.379
[soft thud]
[轻响]

11:05.448 --> 11:08.862
- Ah, I thought
I smelled ice cream.
- 啊，我以为
我闻到了冰淇淋的味道。

11:10.965 --> 11:13.103
- My self-driving days
are over.
- 我的自驾时光
结束了。

11:13.172 --> 11:15.827
- What do you plan on doing
with me, SquarePants?
- 你打算做什么
和我一起吗，方裤？

11:15.896 --> 11:20.241
- Eh, I have an idea.
- 呃，我有一个主意。

11:20.310 --> 11:24.241
- These self-driving boats
are real classy.
- 这些自动驾驶船
真的很优雅。

11:24.310 --> 11:26.137
[laughing]
[笑]

11:26.206 --> 11:28.517
[grumbles]
It stopped again.
[抱怨]
它又停了。

11:28.586 --> 11:29.965
- Don't worry, Patrick.
- 别担心，帕特里克。

11:30.034 --> 11:31.172
Here's a whole bag
of quarters
这是一整袋
宿舍数

11:31.241 --> 11:33.172
so you can ride forever.
这样你就可以永远骑行。

11:33.241 --> 11:35.241
- Ohh!
- 哦！

11:35.310 --> 11:37.655
[exciting gibberish]
【激动人心的胡言乱语】

11:37.724 --> 11:41.862
- Please, somebody,
strip me, sell me for parts.
- 拜托，有人，
把我剥了，卖给我换零件。

11:41.931 --> 11:44.551
Just put me
out of my misery.
就放我吧
出于我的痛苦。

就放我吧
出于我的痛苦。